eing made here in terms of  financial weaponry aid or something of  that sort to ukraine but i hope that we  can also use uh reach out to um business  community here and have them on board  also uh giving up on some of the  revenues that they were probably looking  for  with russian federation  it's now up to the global elite here in  the swiss alps to see if there's an  economic path to peace in the war in  ukraine  you

